# Release archives (the "Source code" zip/tar.gz of a GitHub release, and
# what Zenodo archives) hold only what -net install- installs, plus the
# files that describe it. Everything else is left out: exclude all, then
# re-include by name. Root-anchored, so auxiliary/README.md stays out.
#
# Keep the re-included list in step with the f/F lines of packagesearch.pkg;
# tools/tests/test_archive.py checks that.
*                         export-ignore
/packagesearch.ado        -export-ignore
/packagesearch.sthlp      -export-ignore
/p_whatshot.ado           -export-ignore
/p_stopwords.txt          -export-ignore
/p_stats_econ.dta         -export-ignore
/p_keyword_pkg_xwalk.dta  -export-ignore
/packagesearch.pkg        -export-ignore
/stata.toc                -export-ignore
/LICENSE                  -export-ignore
/CITATION.cff             -export-ignore
/README.md                -export-ignore
